From 6f2be84a1bbd745ef833a589d41e4ff569f3b618 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 04:55:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Faster, smaller exercise page for phones

Exercise page (the student taking an exercise):
- smaller text and tighter spacing: question 1.25rem -> 1.05rem, choices
  and answer box 1.2rem -> 1rem, cards 22px -> 12px padding, smaller
  header/timer/buttons, slimmer choice buttons on phones, name no longer
  overflows the sticky header; start screen made compact too

Loading speed:
- serve Khmer OS Siemreap (31 KB woff2, SIL OFL, license included) from
  /fonts with immutable caching and a preload; remove every request to
  Google Fonts (preconnects, blocking stylesheet, and the @import in the
  student portal)
- useGradeCodes: fetch /api/public/grade-codes (tiny, CDN-cached) instead
  of loading the Firestore client; /student 214 kB -> 106 kB and
  /s/[token] 210 kB -> 102 kB of JavaScript
- screenshot watermark: one repeating SVG tile instead of 260 rotated
  elements (smoother scrolling on cheap phones); name is XML-escaped

Tests: test-fonts updated for self-hosted fonts, new test-watermark.
